+Feature: Clear completed button
+  As a user
+  I want to remove all completed todos at once
+  So that I can clean up finished tasks
+
+  Scenario: Clear completed removes finished todos
+    Given the user has added todos "Buy milk" and "Walk dog"
+    And the todo "Buy milk" is completed
+    When the user clicks the "Clear completed" button
+    Then the todo "Buy milk" is not in the list
+    And a todo item with title "Walk dog" and completed false is in the list
+
+  Scenario: Clear completed button is hidden with no completed todos
+    Given the user has added a todo "Buy milk"
+    Then the "Clear completed" button is not visible
+
+  Scenario: Clear completed button is visible when there are completed todos
+    Given the user has added a todo "Buy milk"
+    And the todo "Buy milk" is completed
+    Then the "Clear completed" button is visible
