+Feature: Active todo counter
+  As a user
+  I want to see how many items are left
+  So that I know my remaining workload
+
+  Scenario: Counter shows zero with no todos
+    Given the app is open with no todos
+    Then the counter shows "0 items left"
+
+  Scenario: Counter shows singular for one active todo
+    When the user types "Buy milk" into the new-todo input and presses Enter
+    Then the counter shows "1 item left"
+
+  Scenario: Counter decreases when a todo is completed
+    Given the user has added todos "Buy milk" and "Walk dog"
+    Then the counter shows "2 items left"
+    When the user completes the todo "Buy milk"
+    Then the counter shows "1 item left"
