@@ -0,0 +1,24 @@
+Feature: New todo entry
+  As a user
+  I want to add new todos by typing and pressing Enter
+  So that I can track tasks I need to do
+
+  Background:
+    Given the app is open with no todos
+
+  Scenario: Creating a todo with a non-empty title
+    When the user types "Buy milk" into the new-todo input and presses Enter
+    Then a todo item with title "Buy milk" and completed false is in the list
+    And the new-todo input is empty
+
+  Scenario: Trims whitespace from new todo titles
+    When the user types "  Buy milk  " into the new-todo input and presses Enter
+    Then a todo item with title "Buy milk" and completed false is in the list
+
+  Scenario: Does not create a todo for whitespace-only input
+    When the user types "   " into the new-todo input and presses Enter
+    Then the todo list is empty
+
+  Scenario: Does not create a todo for empty input
+    When the user presses Enter on the new-todo input
+    Then the todo list is empty
