+Feature: Todo item interactions
+  As a user
+  I want to toggle, edit, and destroy individual todos
+  So that I can manage each task precisely
+
+  Background:
+    Given the user has added a todo "Buy milk"
+
+  Scenario: Toggle a todo to completed
+    When the user clicks the toggle checkbox on the todo "Buy milk"
+    Then the todo "Buy milk" has completed true
+    And the todo "Buy milk" has the CSS class "completed"
+
+  Scenario: Toggle a completed todo to active
+    Given the todo "Buy milk" is completed
+    When the user clicks the toggle checkbox on the todo "Buy milk"
+    Then the todo "Buy milk" has completed false
+
+  Scenario: Destroy a todo
+    When the user hovers over the todo "Buy milk" and clicks the destroy button
+    Then the todo "Buy milk" is not in the list
