@@ -0,0 +1,26 @@
+Feature: Mark all as complete
+  As a user
+  I want to toggle all todos at once
+  So that I can quickly mark everything done or not done
+
+  Background:
+    Given the user has added todos "Buy milk", "Walk dog", and "Write code"
+
+  Scenario: Mark all as complete
+    When the user clicks the toggle-all checkbox to check it
+    Then all todos have completed true
+    And the toggle-all checkbox is checked
+
+  Scenario: Mark all as incomplete
+    Given all todos are completed
+    When the user clicks the toggle-all checkbox to uncheck it
+    Then all todos have completed false
+    And the toggle-all checkbox is unchecked
+
+  Scenario: Toggle-all reflects individual completions
+    When the user completes the todo "Buy milk"
+    Then the toggle-all checkbox is unchecked
+    When the user completes the todo "Walk dog"
+    Then the toggle-all checkbox is unchecked
+    When the user completes the todo "Write code"
+    Then the toggle-all checkbox is checked
